  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: oauthlib 3.2.2+rhlw.1",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released oauthlib 3.2.2+rhlw.1 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-49264 and CVE-2026-49265.\n\nCVE-2026-49264: OAuthLib: Unsafe JSONP callback injection in RevocationEndpoint allows arbitrary JavaScript response generation\n\nCVE-2026-49265: OAuthLib: Timing Attack Vulnerability in PKCE code_verifier Comparison\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for oauthlib 3.2.2 from PyPI.",
